    "title": "Injuries reported after Muni bus, vehicle collide in Mission District: SFFD - NewsBreak",
    "text": "4 hours ago\nSAN FRANCISCO ( KRON ) — A Muni and a vehicle were involved in a crash Wednesday afternoon in the Mission District, according to the San Francisco Fire Department. The crash happened after 4 p.m. at the intersection of 22nd Street and Mission Street.\nTwo people with minor injuries were taken to the hospital, according to SFFD. Another person declined ambulance transport.\nThe public is asked to avoid the area.\nThis story will be updated.\nCopyright 2026 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to KRON4.",
